{
  "_doc": "Bundle order for the Investor Atlas v3 build (paths relative to atlas/). It reuses the investor data, numbers, copy tokens, story and modules of apps/investor, and wears the shared product skin with the RenewaBlox brand. The skin JS comes BEFORE the investor modules so their sheet sections and legends take precedence; the v3 overlay files (apps/investor_v3/investor-v3.js, then v3-sheet.js, v3-present.js and v3-map.js) come last before core/js/app.js (which boots) and adapt the investor modules to the skin: the KPI band becomes the rail's brand card, and the band, its GB power strip and the footer bar are not rendered. apps/investor/investor.css is deliberately not bundled (investor-v3.css restyles the components v3 keeps); present.css comes before the skin so the overlay wins.",
